# Go binaries that `go build ./cmd/<name>` (no -o) drops at src/<name>.
# One anchored line per directory in src/cmd/, so no pattern can hide a real
# file at src/ root. TestGitignoreCoversCmdBinaries (pkg/managementapi) fails
# when a command is missing here. `make build` writes to src/bin/ instead.
